   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Nevertheless, the strong first half performance from a stronger business means we remain on track to meet expectations outlined at our Capital Markets Day last month for full year adjusted PBT of around £160m.",
   "file": "20211215_CURY_Interim-Results-202122.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-14",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
