  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-07",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "However, based on current trends, and allowing for flexibility to continue investing in our customer propositions, we currently expect adjusted PBT to be in range of £130-150m",
